From c0716b0d5a98afb2b3baaac10d72cf56ddfcbf23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ekaunt <ekaunt@maany.cloud>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 02:26:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] callbetter look: close ghost (derez), light cycle,
 focus-parallax grid

- wm_ghost: snapshot a window as its client drops its buffer and keep drawing
  it briefly after close with the "<texture_shaders>_out" shader set
  (cb_out: derez). Compositor side only; xdg and xwayland views take the
  snapshot.
- tron_cb_cycle primitive: a light cycle that rides from the old focused window
  to the new one along a right-angle path through the gap, with a fading trail.
- tron_cb_grid: focus-parallax offset and zoom parallax params (8 params, was 4)
  for the background leaning toward the focused window and zooming with the
  workspace; tron_cb_border reworked.
- quad shaders: fragment_ext variant.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
