 precision highp float;
 /*
  * Focus border in the style of callbetter.com panels (.cc, .cc::before):
- * 1px cyan border, 18px corner brackets, soft outer glow, and a light that
- * traces once around the border when focus changes (tbtrace).
+ * 1px cyan border, 18px corner brackets, soft outer glow, two streaks
+ * spinning slowly around it (the tron look). On focus (a new window gets
+ * focus too) it builds in: the two streaks each race half a lap and draw
+ * the border behind them, and the brackets flicker on (tbflick) as a streak
+ * passes them.
  *
  * 0-3   colour (r, g, b, a)
  * 4     corner radius of the border line
  * 5     inset: widget edge to border line (room for glow and brackets)
  * 6     glow falloff (px)
- * 7     time focus changed (same clock as time)
+ * 7     time focus changed (same clock as time), < 0 once the build-in is over
  * 8     bracket arm length (px)
  * 9     bracket gap: brackets sit this far outside the border line (px)
  * 10    output scale
+ * 11-13 colour of the second spinning streak (the first uses the border colour)
+ * 14    laps per second of the spinning streaks
  */
